<GuidePage
  slug="kitty-party-tambola-ideas"
  description="12 kitty party tambola ideas: themed tickets, fun extra prizes like star and pyramid, dress codes, forfeits, small prize ideas and tips for hosting a smooth housie game."
  intro="Tambola is the heart of many kitty parties, but playing the same five prizes every month can feel routine. These twists keep the game fresh without making it complicated."
